# Fixtures on which vera-next does not yet do what vera does under --emit-exe (then the binary it built)
# (`zig build diff-digital-exe`, tests/differential/comp.zig with v_options): every
# .v fixture's harness command line with `--run` swapped for the flag. One
# line each: the fixture path under tests/conformance/tests, its owner, then
# the first difference. Each line is its owner's debt; a line whose fixture
# also differs under `--run` is comp.xfail's too. A fixture whose only
# difference is the old native codegen's `note:` build remark is ruled in
# digital_exe.rulings instead (T1, research/vbackends.md Q1 Decision B: the
# remark describes how the old side built, not the design's behaviour,
# outside the `--emit-exe` contract — §2).
# A listed fixture that agrees fails the run until its line goes. Refresh:
# -Dcomp-rebaseline writes zig-out/digital_exe.xfail.new.
